# Tech Stack

## Core
| Layer | Choice | Rationale |
|-------|--------|-----------|
| Framework | Next.js 15 (App Router) | Full-stack, RSC, API routes |
| Language | TypeScript | Type safety end-to-end |
| Runtime | Node.js 20+ | LTS, native fetch |

## Database & ORM
| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Supabase | Postgres + Auth + Realtime |
| Drizzle ORM | Type-safe queries, migrations |

## Auth & Payments
| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Supabase Auth | OAuth, magic links, RLS |
| Stripe | Payments, tutor payouts |

## Real-time
| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Supabase Realtime | Tutor matching, notifications |
| Presence | Online status, availability |

## AI Integration
| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Vercel AI SDK | Streaming, tool calling |
| OpenAI | Tutor matching, study plans |

## UI
| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Tailwind CSS | Styling |
| shadcn/ui | Component primitives |
| Framer Motion | Animations |

